WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:09.025
&gt;&gt; Greg: IN NASHVILLE,

00:00:09.026 --> 00:00:10.026
BETO O'ROURKE TOLD IMMIGRANTS

00:00:10.027 --> 00:00:11.928
THAT OUR COUNTRY WAS FOUNDED ON

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:13.997
WHITE SUPREMACY, SLAVERY, AND

00:00:13.998 --> 00:00:14.397
OPPRESSION.

00:00:14.398 --> 00:00:17.067
OTHER THAN THAT, WE ARE AWESOME.

00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:19.970
&gt;&gt; THIS COUNTRY WAS FOUNDED ON

00:00:19.971 --> 00:00:21.104
WHITE SUPREMACY.

00:00:21.105 --> 00:00:22.405
AND EVERY SINGLE INSTITUTION AND

00:00:22.406 --> 00:00:23.974
STRUCTURE THAT WE HAVE IN OUR

00:00:23.975 --> 00:00:26.376
COUNTRY STILL REFLECTS THE

00:00:26.377 --> 00:00:26.943
LEGACY OF SLAVERY AND

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:31.147
SEGREGATION AND JIM CROW AND

00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:32.616
SUPPRESSION, EVEN IN OUR

00:00:32.617 --> 00:00:32.983
DEMOCRACY.

00:00:32.984 --> 00:00:35.051
&gt;&gt; Greg: RIGHT FROM THE WOMB,

00:00:35.052 --> 00:00:36.853
WE ARE ALL RACIST.

00:00:36.854 --> 00:00:39.456
IT'S THE NEW ORIGINAL SIN,

00:00:39.457 --> 00:00:41.791
ACCORDING TO SLENDER MAN.

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:42.726
BETO'S EFFORTS TO SOW DIVISION

00:00:42.727 --> 00:00:43.660
ONLY EXPAND.

00:00:43.661 --> 00:00:46.029
HE'S LIKE A BITTER DIVORCED

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:46.930
HUSBAND TRASHING THE EX-WIFE.

00:00:46.931 --> 00:00:49.466
IF HE CAN'T BE HAPPY, NO ONE

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:49.733
CAN.

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:50.734
IT USED TO BE THE POLITICIANS

00:00:50.735 --> 00:00:52.102
RUNNING FOR OFFICE AND A NUMBER

00:00:52.103 --> 00:00:53.970
OF TOOLS AT THEIR DISPOSAL, NOT

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:54.271
BETO.

00:00:54.272 --> 00:00:55.772
HE IS THE TOOL.

00:00:55.773 --> 00:00:57.974
TALK ABOUT A BLUNT OBJECT.

00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.676
HIS ONLY FUNCTION IS TO CREATE

00:00:59.677 --> 00:01:00.410
VICTIMS OUT OF BROWN AND BLACK

00:01:00.411 --> 00:01:01.912
AMERICANS THAT THEY MIGHT LOOK

00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:04.214
TO HIM, THE GREAT WHITE

00:01:04.215 --> 00:01:06.516
SCARECROW, AS HER SAVIOR.

00:01:06.517 --> 00:01:07.717
NOW HIS TRUE CONFIDENCE IS

00:01:07.718 --> 00:01:08.685
EXPOSED AS A FARCE.

00:01:08.686 --> 00:01:10.086
FOR SO LONG HIS FAILURES WERE

00:01:10.087 --> 00:01:12.088
PROPPED UP BY A BOTTOMLESS

00:01:12.089 --> 00:01:14.157
SPOUSAL INCOME AND ASSISTED BY

00:01:14.158 --> 00:01:16.359
"VANITY FAIR" COVER THIS BONE ON

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:17.994
HIM BY A PALE LIBERAL ENAMORED

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:20.230
HE LOOKED JUST LIKE THEM.

00:01:20.231 --> 00:01:21.798
HE WAS WHITE, PATRONIZING,

00:01:21.799 --> 00:01:24.100
SLICK, AND ELITIST.

00:01:24.101 --> 00:01:27.370
HE IS SO WHITE, WONDER BREAD

00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:28.104
COULD SUE FOR PLAGIARISM.

00:01:28.105 --> 00:01:31.908
HE IS REDUCED TO PLAYING FOR

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:34.444
RADICAL SCRAPS, DANCING TO FIGHT

00:01:34.445 --> 00:01:36.146
SONGS IN SAFE SPACES, A WINDUP

00:01:36.147 --> 00:01:36.780
TOY.

00:01:36.781 --> 00:01:38.582
HE WILL SAY ANYTHING.

00:01:38.583 --> 00:01:40.050
SO NOW WE ARE ALL RACIST BY

00:01:40.051 --> 00:01:42.886
BIRTH, HE SHOUTS, LIKE A

00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:43.920
HOPELESS LONELY SLOB AT LAST

00:01:43.921 --> 00:01:45.021
CALL DESPERATE FOR A PHONE

00:01:45.022 --> 00:01:45.956
NUMBER.

00:01:45.957 --> 00:01:47.624
I WOULD SAY GO HOME, YOU'RE

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:47.924
DRUNK.

00:01:47.925 --> 00:01:50.594
BUT HE MIGHT DRIVE.

00:01:50.595 --> 00:01:53.830
I WONDER IF I WAS NOT MEAN

00:01:53.831 --> 00:01:56.032
ENOUGH.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:58.068
&gt;&gt; Dagen: MORE MEAN.

00:01:58.069 --> 00:02:01.404
&gt;&gt; Greg: WHO THOUGHT THIS GUY

00:02:01.405 --> 00:02:01.905
HAD ANY POTENTIAL?

00:02:01.906 --> 00:02:04.874
ERIC SWALWELL LOOKS LIKE

00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:07.210
CHURCHILL COMPARED TO THIS GUY.

00:02:07.211 --> 00:02:08.411
&gt;&gt; Dagen: INDEED AND HE IS

00:02:08.412 --> 00:02:09.913
BETTER LOOKING.

00:02:09.914 --> 00:02:11.715
HE'S GOING TO FIGHT RACIAL

00:02:11.716 --> 00:02:13.183
INEQUALITY IN THIS COUNTRY

00:02:13.184 --> 00:02:14.317
STARTING WITH A "VANITY FAIR"

00:02:14.318 --> 00:02:17.988
COVER AND THE FOLLOW-UP WAS THE

00:02:17.989 --> 00:02:18.822
STORY IN THE NEW YORKER WHICH

00:02:18.823 --> 00:02:21.791
BASICALLY NO ONE READS AND JUST

00:02:21.792 --> 00:02:22.993
TELLS EVERYBODY ELSE THEY READ

00:02:22.994 --> 00:02:24.461
IT.

00:02:24.462 --> 00:02:26.596
CAN BETO BOUNCE BACK?

00:02:26.597 --> 00:02:28.064
YOU CAN'T PRACTICE IDENTITY

00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:31.601
POLITICS IF YOU HAVE NO PERSONAL

00:02:31.602 --> 00:02:31.968
IDENTITY.

00:02:31.969 --> 00:02:32.969
YOU CAN SEE THE THOUGHT BUBBLE

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:33.403
OVER HIS HEAD.

00:02:33.404 --> 00:02:35.271
WHEN AM I GOING TO DO WHEN I'M

00:02:35.272 --> 00:02:35.739
DONE WITH THIS?

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:38.875
MAYBE I WILL BECOME A DENTIST.

00:02:38.876 --> 00:02:41.945
MAYBE I WILL LEARN HOW TO EAT

00:02:41.946 --> 00:02:47.984
USE ALL GLOOM AND MAKE ALPACA

00:02:47.985 --> 00:02:51.921
THROWS.

00:02:51.922 --> 00:02:55.892
&gt;&gt; Greg: MIGHT CALL IT WOKE

00:02:55.893 --> 00:02:57.460
SHRINKAGE.

00:02:57.461 --> 00:02:58.695
IF YOU CONTENDER TO SMEAR

00:02:58.696 --> 00:03:00.530
EVERYBODY AS OPPRESSORS, THE

00:03:00.531 --> 00:03:02.632
UNION NARROWED THE PARTY INTO AN

00:03:02.633 --> 00:03:03.600
NO ONE IS AROUND.

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.902
I CALL IT WOKE SHRINKAGE.

00:03:05.903 --> 00:03:07.604
I THINK IT'S PRETTY CLEVER.

00:03:07.605 --> 00:03:08.638
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THOUGHT YOU WERE

00:03:08.639 --> 00:03:10.273
SAYING THAT IT SORT OF POLITICAL

00:03:10.274 --> 00:03:11.007
EXPEDIENCY HE IS SAYING AND HE

00:03:11.008 --> 00:03:13.943
WAS TRYING TO IMPACT REJUVENATE

00:03:13.944 --> 00:03:15.979
HIS CANDIDACY WHICH IS WHAT YOU

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.746
ARE SAYING THE NEW YORKER PIECE

00:03:16.747 --> 00:03:19.082
WAS ABOUT.

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:20.450
BUT LET ME JUST SAY I DON'T

00:03:20.451 --> 00:03:22.318
THINK THERE'S ANY DEBATE THAT

00:03:22.319 --> 00:03:23.053
WHAT HE SAID IS TRUE.

00:03:23.054 --> 00:03:25.588
&gt;&gt; Greg: YES THERE IS.

00:03:25.589 --> 00:03:26.990
OUR COUNTRY WAS NOT FOUNDED ON

00:03:26.991 --> 00:03:28.124
WHITE SUPREMACY.

00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:29.092
I WOULD DISAGREE.

00:03:29.093 --> 00:03:30.727
&gt;&gt; Juan: I WOULDN'T BECAUSE I

00:03:30.728 --> 00:03:33.630
WOULD SAY THE FOUNDERS RESERVE

00:03:33.631 --> 00:03:36.633
THE VOTING FRANCHISE FOR

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:37.233
LANDOWNING WHITE MALES.

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:41.638
THAT WAS IT.

00:03:41.639 --> 00:03:43.073
DAGEN AND DANA COULDN'T VOTE.

00:03:43.074 --> 00:03:45.942
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WAS IT FOUNDED ON

00:03:45.943 --> 00:03:47.544
SEXISM?

00:03:47.545 --> 00:03:49.212
&gt;&gt; Juan: YEAH.

00:03:49.213 --> 00:03:50.914
&gt;&gt; Jesse: PILE IT ALL ON.

00:03:50.915 --> 00:03:52.482
&gt;&gt; Juan: I'M NOT PILING IT ON.

00:03:52.483 --> 00:03:54.451
TO SAY IT'S HISTORICAL FACT, I'M

00:03:54.452 --> 00:03:56.853
SAYING IT'S THE FACT.

00:03:56.854 --> 00:03:58.254
&gt;&gt; Jesse: BARACK OBAMA DIDN'T

00:03:58.255 --> 00:04:00.657
EVEN SAY THAT ABOUT OUR COUNTRY.

00:04:00.658 --> 00:04:02.225
HE SAID THE MOST BEAUTIFUL,

00:04:02.226 --> 00:04:03.860
INSPIRING THINGS ABOUT THIS

00:04:03.861 --> 00:04:04.360
NATION'S FOUNDING.

00:04:04.361 --> 00:04:06.096
HE DIDN'T GET CLOSE TO WHAT YOU

00:04:06.097 --> 00:04:07.464
SAID OR BETO O'ROURKE.

00:04:07.465 --> 00:04:08.298
ANY PERSON IS GOING TO RUN FOR

00:04:08.299 --> 00:04:09.232
PRESIDENT OF THIS COUNTRY NEVER

00:04:09.233 --> 00:04:11.935
WOULD SAY SOMETHING LIKE THAT.

00:04:11.936 --> 00:04:12.836
&gt;&gt; Juan: ANYBODY WHO KNOWS

00:04:12.837 --> 00:04:14.571
AMERICAN HISTORY WOULD SAY

00:04:14.572 --> 00:04:15.038
THAT'S REALITY.

00:04:15.039 --> 00:04:15.839
THE QUESTION IS.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.707
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I DON'T THINK

00:04:17.708 --> 00:04:18.641
ANYBODY AGREES WITH THAT.

00:04:18.642 --> 00:04:20.076
&gt;&gt; Juan: HOW CAN YOU DISAGREE

00:04:20.077 --> 00:04:22.445
WITH THE IDEA THAT THE FOUNDING

00:04:22.446 --> 00:04:24.147
FATHERS SAID YOU'VE GOT TO BE A

00:04:24.148 --> 00:04:25.715
LANDOWNING WHITE MALE.

00:04:25.716 --> 00:04:26.616
&gt;&gt; Jesse: JUST BECAUSE

00:04:26.617 --> 00:04:27.851
SOMETHING HAPPENED AT THE TIME

00:04:27.852 --> 00:04:29.552
DOESN'T DEFINE THE FOUNDING.

00:04:29.553 --> 00:04:31.488
&gt;&gt; Juan: WHAT ARE YOU TALKING

00:04:31.489 --> 00:04:31.788
ABOUT?

00:04:31.789 --> 00:04:33.823
&gt;&gt; Jesse: JUST BECAUSE PEOPLE

00:04:33.824 --> 00:04:35.458
HAD SLAVES DURING THE FOUNDING

00:04:35.459 --> 00:04:36.526
DOESN'T MEAN WE ARE FOUNDED ON

00:04:36.527 --> 00:04:37.660
SLAVERY IN WHITE SUPREMACY IS

00:04:37.661 --> 00:04:38.628
ON.

00:04:38.629 --> 00:04:40.463
&gt;&gt; Juan: I THINK THE FACT OF

00:04:40.464 --> 00:04:43.933
OUR AMERICAN --

00:04:43.934 --> 00:04:46.903
&gt;&gt; Jesse: HE DOESN'T DEFINE

00:04:46.904 --> 00:04:47.337
THE FOUNDING.

00:04:47.338 --> 00:04:50.573
&gt;&gt; Juan: LET ME FINISH THIS

00:04:50.574 --> 00:04:50.874
POINT.

00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:51.975
THE LEFT SEES THIS AND I THINK

00:04:51.976 --> 00:04:53.910
BETO O'ROURKE IS REFLECTING IT,

00:04:53.911 --> 00:04:55.845
HE SAYS LET'S FIX IT.

00:04:55.846 --> 00:04:57.814
LET'S DO SOMETHING.

00:04:57.815 --> 00:04:59.349
I THINK THEY ARE RIGHT, LIKE

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.650
YOU, REFUSES TO EVEN SAY YOU

00:05:00.651 --> 00:05:02.352
KNOW IT, IT'S PART OF THE

00:05:02.353 --> 00:05:02.819
ORIGINAL --

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.987
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I ACKNOWLEDGED THAT

00:05:03.988 --> 00:05:06.656
WAS SLAVERY.

00:05:06.657 --> 00:05:07.991
I ACKNOWLEDGED THAT WOMEN OR

00:05:07.992 --> 00:05:09.893
BLACK AMERICANS DIDN'T HAVE

00:05:09.894 --> 00:05:11.294
CERTAIN RIGHTS.

00:05:11.295 --> 00:05:14.197
BUT WE FOUGHT IN 600,000 PEOPLE

00:05:14.198 --> 00:05:15.999
DIED IN THE CIVIL WAR TO

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.234
ERADICATE IT.

00:05:18.235 --> 00:05:19.435
EVERY INSTITUTION IN THIS

00:05:19.436 --> 00:05:20.436
COUNTRY IS RACIST?

00:05:20.437 --> 00:05:22.739
THE MILITARY, THE MEDIA, THE

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:25.575
JUSTICE, THE CULTURE.

00:05:25.576 --> 00:05:27.477
EVERYTHING IS RACIST?

00:05:27.478 --> 00:05:29.179
YOU DON'T AGREE WITH THAT.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.713
&gt;&gt; Juan: THE MILITARY IS OUR

00:05:30.714 --> 00:05:31.414
LEADING EXAMPLE OF DIVERSITY.

00:05:31.415 --> 00:05:36.085
YOU'RE SAYING EVERY SINGLE --

00:05:36.086 --> 00:05:38.121
&gt;&gt; Jesse: YOU'RE SAYING EVERY

00:05:38.122 --> 00:05:40.023
SINGLE INSTITUTION IS RACIST?

00:05:40.024 --> 00:05:42.559
&gt;&gt; Greg: KIDS, MY GOING TO

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:44.394
HAVE TO SEPARATE YOU TWO?

00:05:44.395 --> 00:05:48.097
&gt;&gt; Dana: I'M GOING TO CHANGE

00:05:48.098 --> 00:05:49.966
THE TOPIC.

00:05:49.967 --> 00:05:53.002
&gt;&gt; Greg: JASPER?

00:05:53.003 --> 00:05:53.369
[LAUGHTER]

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.972
&gt;&gt; Dana: NO.

00:05:55.973 --> 00:06:01.010
&gt;&gt; Juan: HE'S MY BROWN BROTHER

00:06:01.011 --> 00:06:01.344
BROTHER.

00:06:01.345 --> 00:06:02.045
&gt;&gt; Dana: I THINK BETO O'ROURKE

00:06:02.046 --> 00:06:03.713
IS THE ONLY ONE WHO DOESN'T KNOW

00:06:03.714 --> 00:06:05.048
HIS CAMPAIGN IS OVER.

00:06:05.049 --> 00:06:06.716
&gt;&gt; Greg: HE IS LIKE BRUCE

00:06:06.717 --> 00:06:09.052
WILLIS IN "THE SIXTH SENSE."

00:06:09.053 --> 00:06:10.186
I DON'T WANT TO SPOIL IT.

00:06:10.187 --> 00:06:15.058
&gt;&gt; Dana: I'VE NEVER SEEN IT.

00:06:15.059 --> 00:06:16.759
DOES THAT HAVE A WEIRD ENDING?

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.461
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU DIDN'T SEE IT?

00:06:18.462 --> 00:06:21.698
YOU DON'T REMEMBER THE ENDING OF

00:06:21.699 --> 00:06:23.433
"THE SIXTH SENSE"?

00:06:23.434 --> 00:06:25.068
IT'S THE WHOLE POINT OF THE

00:06:25.069 --> 00:06:26.035
MOVIE, THE ENDING.

00:06:26.036 --> 00:06:28.671
DO YOU REMEMBER THE ENDING OF

00:06:28.672 --> 00:06:30.006
THE TITANIC?

00:06:30.007 --> 00:06:30.440
&gt;&gt; Dana: YES.

00:06:30.441 --> 00:06:36.679
&gt;&gt; Greg:   JAWS IS ABOUT A

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:36.980
SHARK.

00:06:36.981 --> 00:06:38.948
&gt;&gt; Dana: IF HE KEEPS GOING,

00:06:38.949 --> 00:06:40.049
IT'S GOING TO RUIN HIS FUTURE

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:44.621
POTENTIAL FOR OTHER OFFICES.

00:06:44.622 --> 00:06:47.657
&gt;&gt; Greg: IN THE SIXTH SENSE,

00:06:47.658 --> 00:06:49.492
WHAT HAPPENS IS --

00:06:49.493 --> 00:06:49.959
I CAN'T SAY.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.295
&gt;&gt; Juan: IT'S AN OLD MOVIE.

00:06:52.296 --> 00:06:54.497
YOU CAN DO IT.

00:06:54.498 --> 00:06:56.100
&gt;&gt; Greg: HE WAS DEAD ALL

